  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "In previous versions there would be a form of ear icon showing if you had muted another player, or if another player has muted you. The new nametags show neither, thus there is no way to know if you have muted somebody unless you go to unmute them, and there is no way to know if someone else has muted you.\nHaving a way to know at a semi-quick glance whether you still have someone muted would be nice.\n(The ear icon in the social menu also doesn't go away in either case)",
